# What every recording starts with: `Source tapes/_setup.tape` after its Output lines. The
# shell becomes the demo user's, in /home/demo (the fixture), at the fixture's time.
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"

Hide
Type "source /work/env.sh"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
